cate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.2, pp. 60–61; DjVu scans 68–69"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma\\to\\Delta^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma\\to\\Delta^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\">\\(h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\Delta^*\">\\(K\\subseteq\\Delta^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。词运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\widehat f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*,\\qquad\\widehat f(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\\widehat f(wa)\\coloneqq\\widehat f(w)f(a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\widehat f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*,\\qquad\\widehat f(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\\widehat f(wa)\\coloneqq\\widehat f(w)f(a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\leftrightarrow h(\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;h(uv)=h(u)h(v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\leftrightarrow h(\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;h(uv)=h(u)h(v)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nonerasing}(h)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;h(\\langle a\\rangle)\\ne\\varepsilon\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nonerasing}(h)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;h(\\langle a\\rangle)\\ne\\varepsilon\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\nh[L]\\coloneqq\\{h(w):w\\in L\\},\\qquad h^{-1}[K]\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:h(w)\\in K\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(\\widehat f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}word\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\nh[L]\\coloneqq\\{h(w):w\\in L\\},\\qquad h^{-1}[K]\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:h(w)\\in K\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(\\widehat f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按词长递归给出唯一的扩张。原像的记号不要求同态为单射，也不要求有逆函数；允许擦除的同态必须单独区别于非擦除同态。</p>\n","headin